      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Closer You Get... is the seventh studio album by country music band Alabama, released in 1983. All three singles from this album — \"The Closer You Get\", \"Lady Down on Love\" and \"Dixieland Delight\" — reached Number One on the Hot Country Songs charts in 1983. \"She Put the Sad in All His Songs\" was also recorded by Ronnie Dunn (who formed the duo Brooks & Dunn with Kix Brooks in 1991) and was released by him as a single in 1983.",
